Bookdrop's Z-Library support (bookdrop_zlibrary_provider.lua) is ported from
the Z-Library plugin for KOReader
(https://github.com/ZlibraryKO/zlibrary.koplugin), which is distributed under
the GNU Affero General Public License v3 (AGPL-3.0). The ported code covers
the eAPI client (login, search, book details, download-link resolution), the
base-URL/session handling, and the request-building conventions of that
plugin; the full license text is in LICENSE-AGPL-3.0 alongside this notice,
and the source project is at the URL above.

Per AGPL-3.0, the combined Bookdrop plugin (which contains this AGPL-derived
code alongside its MIT-licensed parts) is distributed under the AGPL-3.0; the
MIT-licensed parts retain their own license for use outside the combined work.

## Manga

Bookdrop bundles the RakuYomi manga plugin (https://github.com/tachibana-shin/rakuyomi,
AGPL-3.0) under bookdrop.koplugin/manga/, vendored from its frontend with one
documented path fix (see manga/README.md). Its license text is in
bookdrop.koplugin/manga/LICENSE-AGPL-3.0, and its Rust server binary is built
per device and dropped into bookdrop.koplugin/manga/server (not committed).
